        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Toby Kebbell, Matthew Hope, Brian Cox, Tony Curran, Adi Bielski\n- Films: Dead Man's Shoes, RocknRolla, War Horse, The Veteran, Wrath of the Titans, Dawn of the Planet of the Apes, Fantastic Four, Warcraft, A Monster Calls, Gold\n- Products: Warcraft video game series\n- Places: Azeroth\n- Topics: film roles, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Toby Kebbell is known for roles in Dead Man's Shoes (2004) and RocknRolla (2008).\n- The Veteran is a 2011 British action film directed by Matthew Hope.\n- The Veteran stars Toby Kebbell, Brian Cox, Tony Curran, and Adi Bielski.\n- Toby Kebbell is known for roles in War Horse (2011) and Wrath of the Titans (2012).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for roles in Dawn of the Planet of the Apes (2014) and Fantastic Four (2015).\n- Warcraft is based on the Warcraft video game series and on novels set in Azeroth.\n- Toby Kebbell is known for roles in Warcraft (2016), A Monster Calls (2016), and Gold (2016).",
